{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_02AF50","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"Aldea de los Despiertos，意思是“醒着的人之村”。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":62,"review_flag":"JPN_COFFEE_PUN_PRESERVED"},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"名字真奇怪。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":18,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"这一带是咖啡产区，附近还有工厂。村里的人也都喜欢咖啡，所以……","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":93,"review_flag":"AUX_VILLAGER_COFFEE_DETAIL_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"也就是说，睡不着觉吗。还挺会开玩笑的。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":57,"review_flag":"JPN_COFFEE_PUN_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"居然占领这样的村子，把它当成战俘营……不可原谅。无论是<R= CIA ,la CIA>，还是受<R= CIA ,la CIA>雇用的人！","cn_control_tokens":"<R= CIA ,la CIA> <R= CIA ,la CIA>","cn_utf8_bytes":140,"review_flag":"RUBY_LOCALIZED_LATIN_READING;JPN_PRISONER_CAMP_DETAIL_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"这个村里的人本来应该过着和平的生活。他们有什么权利践踏这一切！？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":96,"review_flag":"JPN_RIGHTS_REFERENCE_PRIMARY"},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"那些家伙眼里只有自己的权利。很遗憾，世上就是有这种人。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":81,"review_flag":"AUX_SECOND_SENTENCE_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"是这样吗……","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":18,"review_flag":"AUX_ASSERTIVENESS_REMOVED_PER_JPN"},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"交给我吧。对付这种人，也是我们的工作。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":57,"review_flag":"AUX_PUNITIVE_PARAPHRASE_REPLACED_BY_JPN"}]}